DESIGN SPECIFICATION (FIGMA)

FDMA	Frequency	AMPS	Simple	Poor spectrum efficiency
TDMA	Time slots	GSM	Digital, flexible	Needs time synchronisation
CDMA	Codes	IS-95, UMTS	Soft handoff, high capacity	Near-far problem
OFDMA	Time-frequency blocks	LTE, 5G NR	Flexible, robust to fading	Sensitive to frequency offset
SDMA	Space (beams)	MIMO, beamforming	Reuses spectrum	Complex antennas
